flowchart TD
    CLI[CLI: challenge IDs and mode] --> DATA[Pinned local dataset and BM25 index]
    DATA --> OPEN[Mozaik challenge.opened event]
    OPEN --> A[Company Analyst runLoop]
    OPEN --> B[Research Profiler runLoop]
    A -->|source-cited finding| STATE[(Shared RuntimeState)]
    B -->|source-cited finding| STATE
    STATE -->|both findings.ready| W[Matchmaker / Proposal Writer]
    W -->|draft.ready| C[Critic: mechanical checks plus model review]
    C -->|revision.requested: bounded feedback| W
    C -->|accepted or no good match| OUT[Proposal brief, evidence ledger and JSON]
    C -->|budget, timeout or review limit| STOP[Explicit stopped result]
    A -.-> R[Shared runner: limiter, retry and budget]
    B -.-> R
    W -.-> R
    C -.-> R
    R --> MODE{Mode}
    MODE --> MOCK[Official-pattern mock runner: no network]
    MODE --> LIVE[Mozaik model registry and native mappers]
    LIVE --> PROVIDER[Gemini or Anthropic SDK: internal retries off]
    OPEN -.-> TRACE[Observer: JSONL events and actual loop IDs]
    A -.-> TRACE
    B -.-> TRACE
    W -.-> TRACE
    C -.-> TRACE
    R -.-> TRACE
